    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Nothing that stands can be moved. Your inevitability is the kind that absorbs.</em></p><p><strong>Mode: Immovable Object / drift: Away.</strong></p><p>You generate <strong>Ruin Charges</strong> by absorbing damage rather than by breaking things. Each time you take damage <strong>≥ Violence value + Bulwark Initiation</strong> in a single instance and remain upright (Integrity &gt; 0), gain <strong>1 Ruin Charge</strong>. Maximum 1 Ruin Charge generated per turn from this feature.</p><p><strong>End-of-scene conversion.</strong> Any Ruin Charges still in your pool when the scene ends convert <strong>1-for-1 into Frame Dice</strong> on your next Soma Break (replacing the Frame Dice that would otherwise refill from the pool maximum, up to your Frame max).</p>",
